Date: Thu, 28 May 2026 12:06:37 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] cargt/imx93_00363: add DDR timing variant documentation

Document all supported LPDDR4X variants (size, speed, rank), the source
files that implement them, hardware verification status, and design notes
covering the shared-array structure, blank-EEPROM failsafe behaviour, and
512MB validation limitations.
---
 board/cargt/imx93_00363/README.ddr-timing | 202 ++++++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 202 insertions(+)
